==Galician==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|gl|assi||reintegrationist}}
* {{alter|gl|assim||reintegrationist}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|gl|roa-opt|assi}}, from {{inh|gl|VL.|*ad sīc}}. Closely parallel to {{cog|pt|assim}} and {{cog|es|así}}. Compare also {{cog|ca|així}}, {{cog|fr|ainsi}}, {{cog|it|così}}, and {{cog|ro|așa}}.

===Adverb===
{{gl-adv}}

# [[so]], [[thus]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|gl|así como}}
* {{l|gl|así que}}

